---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PhotoSlot from '../components/PhotoSlot.astro';
import { credentials, serviceArea } from '../data/business';
---
<Base
  title="About | Bell Energy Solutions"
  description="Bell Energy Solutions helps people build comfortable, quality homes through consulting, design, and third-party testing in Spokane and Kootenai County."
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About Bell Energy Solutions</h1>
      <p class="lead">We help people build comfortable, quality homes, then third-party test them to prove it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container grid-2">
      <div>
        <h2>What we do</h2>
        <p><a href="/servcies/">See all services</a></p>
        <p>The core of the business is consulting, design, and third-party testing. Bell Energy Solutions helps builders, architects, engineering firms, and home designers plan comfortable, quality homes, then verifies them with third-party testing.</p>
        <p>ERI scores show the results, proving those homes are comfortable and quality-built.</p>
        <p>Commercial blower door testing, including multi-fan setups, is a key part of the business. Thermal imaging, radon testing, and Washington State Energy Code compliance help round out the services. Homeowners can book blower door testing, radon testing, and thermal imaging.</p>
        <p>Bell Energy Solutions primarily works in {serviceArea.summary}.</p>
      </div>
      <PhotoSlot label="Owner portrait or team on site" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Credentials</h2>
      <ul class="checklist" style="max-width:720px">
        {credentials.map((c) => <li>{c}</li>)}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
